    [Doc][Misc] Remove redundant environment variables from Mooncake single node tutorial (#19626)
    
    ### What this PR does / why we need it?
    This PR removes unnecessary environment variables (`HCCL_SOCKET_IFNAME`,
    `OMP_PROC_BIND`, and `OMP_NUM_THREADS`) from the NPU launch scripts in
    the Mooncake single-node disaggregation tutorial.
    
    ### Does this PR introduce _any_ user-facing change?
    No, this is a documentation-only update.
    
    ### How was this patch tested?
    No testing is required for this documentation update.
    - vLLM main:
    https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/commit/c0b6f74bee518aeaf5d72b200a0216e72fbb5e7c
    
    ---------
    
    Signed-off-by: ethan686 <zbw_ethan@163.com>

